  "title": "亚马逊 534 亿非运营收入背后的现金流隐忧",
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "大家可能注意到亚马逊财报里有个惊人的数字：非运营税前其他收入高达 534 亿美元，这主要来自于对 Anthropic 的投资。",
      "kind": "fact",
      "fact_ids": [
        "g029"
      ],
      "segment_id": "p1",
      "slot_ids": [
        "L01"
      ],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但这笔巨额投入虽然推高了账面利润，代价却是自由现金流转为净流出。",
      "kind": "interpretation",
      "segment_id": "p2",
      "slot_ids": [],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": [],
      "fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "具体来看，自由现金流较上年减少了 661 亿美元，这主要源于资本支出的大幅增加。",
      "kind": "fact",
      "fact_ids": [
        "g032"
      ],
      "segment_id": "p3",
      "slot_ids": [
        "L03"
      ],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
    },
    {
      "text": "不过核心业务依然强劲，北美分部销售额达到 1162 亿美元，显示出亚马逊在基本盘上的韧性。",
      "kind": "fact",
      "fact_ids": [
        "g015"
      ],
      "segment_id": "p4",
      "slot_ids": [
        "L05"
      ],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
    },
    {
      "text": "虽然交付速度提升了 40%，但市场更担心的其实是长期资本开支的可持续性。",
      "kind": "interpretation",
      "fact_ids": [
        "g035"
      ],
      "segment_id": "p5",
      "slot_ids": [
        "L02"
      ],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
    },
    {
      "text": "如果未来云厂商支出缩减，当前的利润结构将面临剧烈调整。",
      "kind": "interpretation",
      "segment_id": "p6",
      "slot_ids": [],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": [],
      "fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "性能提升 25% 的 Graviton 芯片虽好，却难以完全抵消资本开支带来的现金流压力。",
      "kind": "interpretation",
      "fact_ids": [
        "g037"
      ],
      "segment_id": "p7",
      "slot_ids": [
        "L04"
      ],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": []
    },
    {
      "text": "唯有当经营利润能持续超过资本支出时，这种扩张模式才具备长期价值。",
      "kind": "condition",
      "segment_id": "p8",
      "slot_ids": [],
      "model_written_digits": [],
      "proposed_thresholds": [],
      "misframed_values": [],
      "fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
